.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-billing-estimate - Hourly, daily and monthly cost of plans and serverless containers; how long your balance lasts


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro billing estimate [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Plans (Istanbul servers, container plans) are capped at their monthly price. Serverless containers (--cpu-m/--memory-mi, or --item /:) are billed per running copy per hour without a cap; sizes: gyro container sizes.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--count\fP=1
	how many

.PP
\fB--cpu-m\fP=0
	serverless container: CPU per copy in millicores (250, 500, 1000, 2000, 4000)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for estimate

.PP
\fB--hours\fP=0
	serverless container: running hours for the total (default 730)

.PP
\fB--item\fP=[]
	plan:count or serverless /:count, repeatable

.PP
\fB--memory-mi\fP=0
	serverless container: memory per copy in MiB (see gyro container sizes)

.PP
\fB--plan\fP=""
	plan name, e.g. standart-2-4

.PP
\fB--product-id\fP=0
	or the product id

.PP
\fB--region\fP="tr-ist-1"
	region (prepaid: tr-ist-1)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gyro billing estimate --plan standart-2-4 --region tr-ist-1 --count 3
  gyro billing estimate --item standart-2-4:2 --item standart-4-8:1
  gyro billing estimate --cpu-m 500 --memory-mi 1024 --count 2 --hours 730
  gyro billing estimate --item 250/512:3 --item standart-2-4:1
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-billing(1)\fP
